From f2e7a75d98d1f9b635ee9ec9ddd25672c9b1b3d1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cindy Krafft <cynthiacondra@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 00:48:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Fix TypeError in scrub_doublets(mean_center=True,
 normalize_variance=False)

pipeline_mean_center subtracts an np.matrix of gene means from the sparse
normalised matrix, which yields an np.matrix; sklearn's PCA rejects
np.matrix input ('np.matrix is not supported'), so this option
combination has not run since scikit-learn started refusing it. Convert to
an ndarray, as pipeline_zscore already does.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
